{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31892","headline":"送雍陶及第归成都宁亲 · 贾岛","name":"送雍陶及第归成都宁亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不唯诗着籍，兼又赋知名。\n议论於题称，春秋对问精。\n半应阴隲与，全赖有司平。\n归去峯峦衆，别来松桂生。\n涨江流水品，当道白云坑。\n勿以攻文捷，而将学劒轻。\n制衣新濯锦，开酝旧烧罂。\n同日昇科士，谁同膝下荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}